On Apr 11, 10:49 pm, Dingbat Charlie <n...@nowhere.net> wrote:
> What kind of ring allows you to see Mimics in shops?  Is it protection
> from shape changers?

You don't need rings to detect Mimics in shops.  Just throw a gold
piece down every row in the shop.  (Make sure the shopkeeper isn't in
the line of fire though)

If it doesn't hit anything, then there isn't a mimic in that row.  If
it does hit a mimic, then you can deal with the mimic however you
want, because you aren't in melee range of it, so you don't have to
worry about it sticking to you.

Mimics are really slow, and if you don't want to deal with a mimic
that you woke up, then you can run out of the mimic's line-of-sight,
which will cause it to go back to sleep.



